  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nDecoding signs:\n\n \n \n\n Sign\n A\n B\n C\n D\n \n \n\n Stands For\n ÷\n ×\n +\n -\n \n \n\nGiven: 22 D 55 A 5 C 14 B 8 = ?\n\n22 D 55 A 5 C 14 B 8 = ? ⇒ 22 - 55 ÷ 5 + 14 × 8 = ?\n\n⇒ 22 - __**55 **____**÷**____** 5**__ + 14 × 8 = ?\n\n⇒ 22 - 11 + __**14 **____**×**____** 8**__ = ?\n\n⇒ __**22 + 112**__ - 11 = ?\n\n⇒ __**134 - 11**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 123 = ?\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
